====== Build steps ======

===== Before =====

  - Install Rust
  - Clone the code
    - Use the main branch

===== Checks =====

^ Check  ^ Command          ^
| Format | cargo fmt        |
| Lint   | cargo clippy     |
| Test   | cargo nextest    |

See [[https://example.org/build|the build guide]] and [[https://example.org/docker|the container guide]].
